Type When <code>*academyos.ValidationError</code> The course failed course-spec validation locally; <code>Findings</code> lists why <code>*academyos.APIError</code> The server answered with an error: <code>Status</code>, a <code>Code</code> such as <code>stale_revision</code>, <code>course_exists</code>, <code>invalid_course</code> or <code>unauthorized</code>, and the server's <code>Findings</code> or <code>Changed</code> paths <pre><code>var apiErr *academyos.APIError
if errors.As(err, &amp;apiErr) &amp;&amp; apiErr.Code == "stale_revision" {
    // The academy's copy changed since the last push.
}
</code></pre>
